| Wave | Run together |
|---|---|
| 1 | P0 |
| 2 | P1 |
| 3 | P2 |
| 4 | P3 |
| 5 | P4 |
| 6 | P5 |
| 7 | P6 |
| 8 | P7 |
| 9 | P8 |
| 10 | P9 |
