 173: Source range ends are inclusive. Text offsets are UTF-16 code-unit indexes with start inclusive/end exclusive; compare against exactly the canonical string without normalization during verification.
 174: seq is a nonnegative integer, storyTime a finite chronology ordinal. Episode/Moment/Beat display order starts at 1; paragraph seq starts at 0. p + six-digit seq follows new.md; overflow of the supported ID range fails explicitly rather than truncating.
