 307: BookCatalog, not stale prev/next fields inside immutable bundles, determines currently available neighboring episodes. Use versioned catalog objects plus a small revalidated active pointer; long-lived immutable caching belongs to versioned assets/bundles only.
 308: External Reader sessions pin a version while reading. Stable IDs persist when meaning is unchanged; changed/split/deleted Beats get explicit progress anchors, falling back to source seq within the same sourceId. Cross-source progress mapping is explicit or unresolved, never a silently reused paragraph ID.
