+### LATER / OWNER-ONLY
+
+1. Resolve D-1 with the owner-selected real provider sample and recorded evidence.
+2. Run P13 only after P10/P11 and all blocking defects are resolved: owner-authorized paid calls, real source/model review, live release, and real-device quality assessment.
+3. Confirm artistic continuity and mobile quality manually. Machine checks can establish structural correctness but cannot certify those judgments.
+
+## Explicit unverified limits
+
+This audit did not verify a live provider, paid generation, real editorial content, Firebase emulator authorization, production browser readiness, live publication, rollback against deployed storage, cross-session progress retention, actual mobile hardware, or artistic quality. It also did not run unsafe autonomous `smoke-e2e.mts` or `smoke-formats.mts`. Green fake/static tests must not be presented as evidence for those limits.
